strength, dielectric constant and volume resistance, low dielectric loss, good mechanical performance and dimension stability.</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> BOPET capacitor film also called PET Capacitor film,clear Polyester capacitor film,transparent Polyester capacitor film,</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Thickness:3-12UM Width: 500,620,910,980,1010,1300 MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Net weight per roll about: 50KGS/roll </span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Inner plastic tube core: 3'',6''(76MM ,152MM )</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> 2.) BOPET metalized VM/--Zn/Al capacitor film (Metallized BOPET Capacitor Film,sliver PET Capacitor film). Thickness:3-12UM Width: 500,620,910,980,1010,1300 MM</span></p> <p><br/></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (85, 200, 'BOPP/BOPET Metallized Capacitor Film (silver)', '../upload/image/20180925/20180925232941_56983.jpg', '<p></p><p>BOPP/BOPET Metallized Capacitor Film (silver)</p> <p>Metallized BOPP/BOPET Capacitor Film (silver film) have two items : <br/> 1. Zn/Al Metallized BOPP/BOPET Capacitor Film (silver film)<br/> 2. Al Metallized BOPP/BOPET Capacitor Film (silver film)<br/> Metallized BOPP/BOPET Capacitor Film were also called silver pp Capacitor film, zn/al BOPP capacitor film,Polypropylene metallized Film, Zn metallized capacitor bopp film, CBB capacitor metallized film<br/> reinforced edge ( of Aluminum/Zinc film ) are : 1.5,2.0,2.5 MM</p> <p>The standard thickness range including: 3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,12 microns .<br/> The standard tolerance thickness: +/-0.2 Um .<br/> The standard width range including: 30,40,50,60,70,80,90,100,120,130 MM<br/> The standard tolerance width: +/-5 MM.<br/> The inner core : 3" (76MM)<br/> The outer core: 150-350 MM .<br/> Features:1) single side corona treated for the Zn or Zn/Al metallized .</p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (85, 248, 'Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver)', '../upload/image/20180925/20180925232917_94696.jpg', '<p><span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;">Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver)</span></p><p style=''color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:"font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span><span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film) have two items :</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">1. Zn/Al Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film)</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">2. Al Metallized BOPP Capacitor Film (sliver film)</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">reinforced edge ( of Aluminum/Zinc film ) are : 1.5,2.0,2.5 MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The standard thickness range including: 3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,12 microns .</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The standard tolerance thickness: +/-0.2 Um .</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The standard width range including: 30,40,50,60,70,80,90,100,120,130 MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The standard tolerance width: +/-5 MM.</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The inner core : 3" (76MM)</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">The outer core: 150-350 MM .</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">Features:</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">1) single side corona treated for the