olor:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The standard tolerance thickness: +/-0.2 Um .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The standard width range including: 30,40,50,60,70,80,90,100,120,130 MM</span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The standard tolerance width: +/-5 MM.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The inner core : 3" (76MM)</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The outer core: 150-350 MM .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Features:1) single side corona treated for the Zn or Zn/Al metallized .</span></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><br/> </span></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:24px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3. Featuring &amp;</span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:24px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Technology data: </span></span></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color: