ahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Free margin – 2,5 mm, </span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Heavy edge – yes,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Metallization – Al + Zn with one lateral margin, </span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Surface resistance - (5-10) ohms/sq in active area, (2-4) ohms/sq in heavy edge area:</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Inner diameter of core – 75 ÷ 76 mm,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- External diameter of a roll – 240 mm, approximately.</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">Technical requirements on biaxially oriented polypropylene (BOPP) film for impregnated </span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">power capacitors </span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Surface – smoothness or roughness,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Thickness – 6 - 15,2 μm,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Width – 65 - 325 mm,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- Inner diameter of core – 75 ÷ 76 mm,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:#FFFF00;">- External diameter of a roll – 220 mm max,</span></span></strong></em><br/> <em><strong><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:18px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:36px;font-family:Tahoma;font-